hoermann-supramatic3-esphome
============================

This project is a modified copy of the ESPHome components `uapbridge` and
`uapbridge_esp` from:

  mariopenzendorfer/esphome-hoermann_supramatic_3
  https://github.com/mariopenzendorfer/esphome-hoermann_supramatic_3
  (based on commit 20f6509849c80b6424b68f63476470535f04200a), MIT License

which itself is a fork of

  14yannick/hoermann_door      https://github.com/14yannick/hoermann_door      (MIT)
  Abildgren/hoermann_door      https://github.com/Abildgren/hoermann_door
  stephan192/hoermann_door     https://github.com/stephan192/hoermann_door     (MIT, Copyright (c) 2021 stephan192)

The ESP-only port (without PIC16) is credited by the upstream README to @Rezoran.
The original MIT copyright and permission notice is kept in LICENSE.

components/uapbridge/       copy from upstream, small additions since 1.0.1 (see CHANGELOG.md)
components/uapbridge_esp/   modified (see CHANGELOG.md)

Protocol background (links only, nothing copied):
  - upstream docs/hoermann.md
  - https://blog.bouni.de/posts/2018/hoerrmann-uap1/
  - https://github.com/avshrs/ESP32_Hormann_Supramatic_e3 (stop command, referenced in source)

Everything else (P series findings, inject mode v2, drawings, documentation)
is based on our own observations on our own drives.

Trademarks: "Hörmann", "SupraMatic" and "UAP1" are trademarks of their
respective owners. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed or supported
by Hörmann. No Hörmann firmware, source code, documents or schematics are
included.
